    "grounding": "docs/reference/oral-morphology.md",
    "staging": "pTNM derived by src/staging/oral.js, with the system chosen by the tumour site and, in the oropharynx, by p16: AJCC 8th edition for the oral cavity and AJCC 9th edition for HPV-associated (p16 positive) oropharyngeal carcinoma. An oropharyngeal carcinoma without a positive p16 is HPV-independent, staged on a protocol not built here, and gets no pTNM."
  },
